        "content": "<p>Claude and I wrote a BASIC repl in Roc web assembly:</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://143.244.172.148:9203/basic/basic.html\">http://143.244.172.148:9203/basic/basic.html</a></p>\n<p>The interpreter is pure Roc with a thin JS layer for the REPL.</p>\n<p>More details here: <a href=\"http://143.244.172.148:9100/notes/roc-basic-interpreter.md\">http://143.244.172.148:9100/notes/roc-basic-interpreter.md</a></p>\n<p>The IP address is just my Digital Ocean droplet. At some point I'll get a proper domain name. :)</p>",
        "id": 623875018,
        "sender_full_name": "Steve Howell",
        "timestamp": 1789308975
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>repo: <a href=\"https://github.com/showell/roc-apps/blob/master/basic/roc\">https://github.com/showell/roc-apps/blob/master/basic/roc</a></p>",
